  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/124",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">용수철을 이용하여 물체의 무게 측정하기 가상실험이다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">실험실에 가지 않고 컴퓨터나 스마트폰으로&nbsp;실험이 가능하다. 또는 직접 실험하기 전에 실험방법을 익히는데 활용할 수도 있다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">그리고 실제 실험실에서 실험해 보면 첫번째 측정값이 제대로 나오지 않는 경우까지 똑같이 만들었다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">가상실험을 통해 실제 실험에서 오류가 나는 부분도 다시 생각하고 실험을 보완해 볼 수 있다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;스마트폰용은 플레이 스토어에서 '용수철 무게측정 가상실험' 으로 검색하면 설치할 수 있다.&gt;<br><a style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.springweight\"><b><u><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.springweight</span></u></b></a><i></i><sub></sub><sup></sup><strike></strike><br></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&lt;실험전 알아두기&gt;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">과학실에 비치된 당김용 용수철의 경우 용수철이 딱 붙어 있으므로 처음 위치가 평형점이 아니다. 그래서 실험 결과가 비례 형태로 나오지 않고 처음 측정한 값이 왜곡되게 측정될 수 있다. 이때문에 처음 1개의 추를 매단 후, 두 번째 추부터 추의 개수를 1개로 정하고 측정을 하면 실험 결과를 정확히 얻을 수 있다. 또한 용수철 끝 부분에 금속 고리를 사용하는 방법도 있다.</span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"380\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile24.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99B000425CEF5A1C379249\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;사용법&gt;<br>1. 용수철 우측의 추를 드래그 해서 용수철 저울에 달면서 늘어난 길이를 측정해 보자<br>2. 추의 갯수를 늘려가면서 늘어난 길이를 측정해 보자<br>3. 이론처럼 비례하지 않으면 용수철 저울에 고리를 먼저 연결하고 측정해 보자</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (고리를 다는 경우에는 1번째 값은 무시)</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">4. 늘어나 있는 용수철은 기본 용수철을 어느정도 잡다 당겨 놨기 때문에 처음부터 실험해도 정상적으로 비례관계가 나타남을 알 수 있다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"378\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile23.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F993B8A455CEF5B3D0BA943\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 2.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;문제출제&gt;<br>1. 문제출제 버튼을 누르면 A,B,C,D,E,F 중에 1개의 추만 용수철에 걸 수 있다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">2. 임의 물체의 무게를 측정해서 알아내 보자.<br>2. 추 F는 실행 할 때 마다 무게가 무작위로 변한다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"379\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile29.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F995D3E395CEF7264302C06\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 3.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;추가질문&gt;<br>1. 고리의 무게도 측정할 수 있을까?</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&lt;수업활용 팁&gt;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">실제 수업시간에 앞에서 컴퓨터로 실험을 보여 주었다. (1Kg 을 걸때마다 10cm씩 늘어난다)</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">그리고 문제출제를 눌러 A물체를 용수철에 걸어 주었다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">무게</span></u></strong>는 얼마일까? 맞추는 모둠 건빵 줌</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">거의 대부분 모둠이 25cm 늘어나니까 2.5Kg 이라고 답변한다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">'땡' </p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">갑자기 분주해 진다. 측정값이 35cm 니까 3.5Kg '땡'</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">결국 Kg은 질량의 단위니까 무게 단위로 환산하면 약 25N이라는 걸 알아낸다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">(처음 가상실험을 만들다가 추안에 무게단위가 아닌 질량단위를 무심코 적어 넣었는데</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">수업시간에 활용해 보니 질량과 무게의 관계를 이해시키는데 더 의미 가 있다.</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">그래서 추의 질량과 무게 단위를 변환할 수 있는 옵션을 만들고 질량단위가 추에 기본으로 나타나게 했다.)</p><p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p>가살실험 화일이 안 올라가네요. 첨부화일은 아래 링크에서 다운 받을 수 있습니다.<br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(150, 150, 150); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-siz